# Media served by GitHub Pages is kept as regular git objects on purpose.
# Do NOT move *.mp4 / *.jpg to Git LFS: GitHub Pages does not resolve LFS
# objects on a branch deploy and would serve the pointer text file instead of
# the video. See github/community discussion 50337.
*.mp4  binary
*.mov  binary
*.webm binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.svg  text
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
